            "notes": "[Double Dosage](item_80f07e6e-56f9-40a5-9f5e-ba9005998b28) has big synergy with [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e). Be sure you get unless you team is missing some heals, you can purchase  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) on that case.\n\nStart building more WP if you can afford it, if someone dares to flank you then its time to send a message: Sleep, spray, tbag and kill (repeat if needed), for this you can get  [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) if you are the real sandman, if you want to be more lethal you can pick  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) or even  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) if you already can afford it",
