            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-25T21:10:58.638314+00:00",
            "notes": "Sadly, this is a team based game, so it is ideal to use your teammates as distractors, human shields, and sometimes to do useful stuff... this is the round to really start doing that, [Our Turn](item_6e0fdb41-c00f-41d9-8ec2-1246b34a539a) is so damn good and gets better and better when you stack WP as you will get to spam it more and more.\n\n [Eye of Horus](item_169551ce-e4e5-4a14-9ec4-abdc25673939) will not only work to save your tank if walled or if it always get out of your LOS, but it will also ignore walls and basically nano your whole team with 0 effort. Please consider:\n\n-Your target will get the full version of nano, be smart and still use your nano on the best target you can find\n\n-You don't need the whole team to be grouped thanks to this item, even if they are on your spawn or enemy spawn they will get it but please don't be dumb, use it whenever your team is ready to do something or your whole team needs big protection, Lucio dreams with soundbarrier being this cool, make him jealous using it at its full potential",
